      "text": "If empirical formula of compound <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PQ</mi></math>, then the empirical formula of the compound <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>.",
      "isCorrect": true,
